No result document is frozen until an exact-head code run succeeds.

## Scientific outcomes

All outcomes are informative.

A positive nonclassical obstruction would strengthen v15.53 by showing that the obstruction is not exhausted by the registered classical comparator sector.

If the v15.53 obstruction becomes classically reproducible under this gate, that closes the stronger interpretation for the tested family and prevents overclaiming.

If no operational witness survives, report that result without tuning the witness after exposure.

## Claim firewall

Always preserve:

- source_correspondence=NOT_EVALUATED
- Pillar_3=OPEN
- no physical source law
- no gravity or Einstein-equation claim
- no geometry/curvature certification
- no continuum-limit claim
- no empirical fit
